      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A randomized study of two intravenous schedules of Clodronate showed that a single 4-hour infusion of 1500 mg Clodronate proved significantly more effective than the traditional 2 hours infusion of 300 mg during 5 days. The regimen may prove preferable in therapy of patients with painful bone metastases."},
